Package: sdvmodels
Title: Models for the 'SportsDataverse' Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saiem", "Gilani", , "saiem.gilani@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7194-9067"))
  )
Description: A data package that hosts the fitted models used by the
    'cfbfastR' package and the wider 'SportsDataverse' ecosystem, so the
    models are versioned and installed once instead of being downloaded by
    each consumer. Ships the college football expected points, win
    probability (with and without the point spread), field goal, fourth
    down conversion, two point conversion, expected pass, completion
    probability and quarterback rating models as raw 'xgboost' model
    vectors, together with the punt distance distribution, the field
    position expected points table, the model cards and the bundle
    manifest that documents each model's feature contract. Mirrors the
    'fastrmodels' package of the 'nflverse'.
